✅ **No God Function**: Delegates all logic to focused, single-responsibility components  
✅ **Clean Composition**: Linear pipeline with clear separation of concerns  
✅ **Error Handling**: Proper error flow using response builder interface

The refactored function now acts as a pure orchestrator, composing the extracted functions into a clean, maintainable pipeline.

